  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3002.08 Baseline emission rate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.08 \"Baseline emission rate\" means the lesser of a an ERC or DER generating source's actual emission rate or allowable emission rate considering all applicable State and Federal regulations, as certified by the department.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
